{
  "contractId": "KG-ADMIN-v0.1",
  "owner": "develop / KG-PARALLEL-10-WS-27",
  "status": "LOCAL_CANDIDATE_NOT_DEPLOYED",
  "schemaDialect": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "sourceModules": ["services/backend/src/admin.ts", "services/backend/src/admin-session.ts"],
  "inventoryRule": "operations must equal the routes actually registered by sourceModules (tests/contract/ws27-contracts.test.ts compares against Fastify onRoute). Policy promotion (POST /v1/admin/policies/promote) lives in contracts/registration.v0.1.json per the wave-3 split.",
  "sharedBehaviors": [
    "Authority is decided on the server from a live kg_membership.role_grants row (role_id='ADMIN', revoked_at IS NULL, starts_at<=now(), ends_at IS NULL OR ends_at>now()). A client-sent admin flag does not exist. A session without a live ADMIN grant gets 403 ADMIN_REQUIRED before any member data is read.",
    "Status is the effective status: a member with a live restriction row reads as RESTRICTED even when members.status is ACTIVE.",
    "E-mail is masked in list/detail responses as emailMasked (first two characters of the local part + at least three '*'). The raw email is still present in the member detail response because the handler spreads the member row — see openItems.",
    "phoneMasked is the stored members.phone_masked value (WS-28, format 010-****-1234) or null when the member has no masked phone. The raw phone number is never stored or returned.",
    "Every restrict/release writes kg_membership.audit_log (action MEMBER_RESTRICTED / MEMBER_RELEASED, reason, restrictionId).",
    "Operator sessions (WS-23): POST /v1/admin/session exchanges a real member session token for a dedicated admin-scope token (adm_ prefix, 2-hour TTL, never refreshed). The exchange re-reads a live ADMIN role grant; a non-admin gets 403 ADMIN_REQUIRED. A member token on an admin route gets 403 ADMIN_SESSION_REQUIRED and an admin token on a member route gets 401 SESSION_INVALID (scope separation in both directions).",
    "Admin login brute force: 5 failed exchanges per client within 15 minutes lock the client for 5 minutes (429 ADMIN_LOGIN_LOCKED with Retry-After). The counter is per-process memory; every failure/lock/issue/logout is appended to audit_log.",
    "Review moderation (WS-26): hide/unhide are operator-only and never delete. hidden_at/hidden_reason are set, the row stays, and the public review list already filters on hidden_at IS NULL. Both actions require an explicit reason (2..500 characters) and write REVIEW_HIDDEN / REVIEW_UNHIDDEN to audit_log.",
    "All routes respond with Cache-Control: no-store and X-Server-Time."
  ],
  "operations": [
    {
      "id": "adminSessionCreate",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/admin/session",
      "authentication": "none",
      "source": "services/backend/src/admin-session.ts",
      "requestSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["sessionToken"],
        "properties": {
          "sessionToken": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{32,256}$" }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "201": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": ["adminToken", "tokenType", "expiresInSeconds", "expiresAt", "operator"],
          "properties": {
            "adminToken": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^adm_[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$" },
            "tokenType": { "type": "string", "const": "Bearer" },
            "expiresInSeconds": { "type": "integer", "const": 7200 },
            "expiresAt": { "$ref": "#/definitions/Timestamp" },
            "operator": { "$ref": "#/definitions/Operator" }
          }
        }
      },
      "notes": "Exchanges a real member session token for a dedicated admin-scope token. An admin token is never exchangeable again (400 INVALID_REQUEST). The raw client address is never stored; only a salted digest is used as the limiter key.",
      "errors": [
        { "status": 400, "code": "INVALID_REQUEST", "when": "schema violation or the supplied token is already an admin token" },
        { "status": 401, "code": "SESSION_INVALID", "when": "the member session token is unknown, revoked or expired" },
        { "status": 403, "code": "ADMIN_REQUIRED", "when": "the member has no live ADMIN role grant" },
        { "status": 429, "code": "ADMIN_LOGIN_LOCKED", "when": "5 failed exchanges within 15 minutes; Retry-After carries the remaining lock seconds" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "adminSessionGet",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/admin/session",
      "authentication": "admin",
      "source": "services/backend/src/admin-session.ts",
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": ["operator", "expiresAt"],
          "properties": {
            "operator": { "$ref": "#/definitions/Operator" },
            "expiresAt": { "$ref": "#/definitions/Timestamp" }
          }
        }
      },
      "errors": [
        { "status": 401, "code": "AUTH_REQUIRED", "when": "missing or malformed Authorization header" },
        { "status": 401, "code": "SESSION_INVALID", "when": "the admin session is unknown, revoked or expired" },
        { "status": 403, "code": "ADMIN_SESSION_REQUIRED", "when": "the bearer token is a member session, not an admin session" },
        { "status": 403, "code": "ADMIN_REQUIRED", "when": "the session owner has no live ADMIN role grant" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "adminSessionLogout",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/admin/session/logout",
      "authentication": "admin",
      "source": "services/backend/src/admin-session.ts",
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": ["loggedOut"],
          "properties": { "loggedOut": { "type": "boolean", "const": true } }
        }
      },
      "notes": "Revokes the admin session row and writes ADMIN_SESSION_LOGGED_OUT to audit_log.",
      "errors": [
        { "status": 401, "code": "AUTH_REQUIRED", "when": "missing or malformed Authorization header" },
        { "status": 401, "code": "SESSION_INVALID", "when": "the admin session is unknown, revoked or expired" },
        { "status": 403, "code": "ADMIN_SESSION_REQUIRED", "when": "the bearer token is a member session, not an admin session" },
        { "status": 403, "code": "ADMIN_REQUIRED", "when": "the session owner has no live ADMIN role grant" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "adminMembers",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/admin/members",
      "authentication": "admin",
      "source": "services/backend/src/admin.ts",
      "querySchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "query": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 100 },
          "status": { "type": "string", "enum": ["ACTIVE", "RESTRICTED", "WITHDRAWN"] },
          "page": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{1,6}$" },
          "limit": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{1,3}$" }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": ["page", "limit", "total", "totalPages", "members"],
          "properties": {
            "page": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
            "limit": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 100 },
            "total": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
            "totalPages": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
            "members": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/definitions/MemberListItem" } }
          }
        }
      },
      "notes": "query searches name/nickname/e-mail ILIKE and exact customer_no. LIKE wildcards in query are escaped. page defaults to 1, limit defaults to 20 (max 100).",
      "errors": [
        { "status": 400, "code": "INVALID_REQUEST", "when": "unknown query property, status outside the enum, page/limit not matching the digit pattern" },
        { "status": 401, "code": "AUTH_REQUIRED", "when": "missing or malformed Authorization header" },
        { "status": 403, "code": "ADMIN_REQUIRED", "when": "session is valid but has no live ADMIN role grant" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "adminMember",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/admin/members/:id",
      "authentication": "admin",
      "source": "services/backend/src/admin.ts",
      "paramsSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["id"],
        "properties": { "id": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" } }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": ["member", "restrictions", "consents", "ledgers", "roles"],
          "properties": {
            "member": { "$ref": "#/definitions/MemberDetail" },
            "restrictions": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/definitions/Restriction" } },
            "consents": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/definitions/ConsentRecord" } },
            "ledgers": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/definitions/MemberLedger" } },
            "roles": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/definitions/RoleGrant" } }
          }
        }
      },
      "notes": "Ledgers are capped at the 50 most recently updated. Withdrawn members are still readable here for operator review.",
      "errors": [
        { "status": 400, "code": "INVALID_REQUEST", "when": ":id is not a uuid" },
        { "status": 401, "code": "AUTH_REQUIRED", "when": "missing or malformed Authorization header" },
        { "status": 403, "code": "ADMIN_REQUIRED", "when": "session is valid but has no live ADMIN role grant" },
        { "status": 404, "code": "MEMBER_NOT_FOUND", "when": "member does not exist" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "adminMemberRestrict",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/admin/members/:id/restrict",
      "authentication": "admin",
      "source": "services/backend/src/admin.ts",
      "paramsSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["id"],
        "properties": { "id": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" } }
      },
      "requestSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["reason"],
        "properties": {
          "reason": { "type": "string", "minLength": 2, "maxLength": 500 },
          "endsAt": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "201": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": ["id", "reason", "startsAt", "endsAt", "revokedAt", "memberId", "status"],
          "properties": {
            "id": { "$ref": "#/definitions/Uuid" },
            "reason": { "type": "string" },
            "startsAt": { "$ref": "#/definitions/Timestamp" },
            "endsAt": { "$ref": "#/definitions/NullableTimestamp" },
            "revokedAt": { "$ref": "#/definitions/NullableTimestamp" },
            "memberId": { "$ref": "#/definitions/Uuid" },
            "status": { "type": "string", "enum": ["RESTRICTED"] }
          }
        }
      },
      "notes": "Restriction is applied per principal, not per member: all accounts of the same principal are restricted.",
      "errors": [
        { "status": 400, "code": "INVALID_REQUEST", "when": "reason shorter than 2 characters, endsAt not in the future, or schema violation" },
        { "status": 401, "code": "AUTH_REQUIRED", "when": "missing or malformed Authorization header" },
        { "status": 403, "code": "ADMIN_REQUIRED", "when": "session is valid but has no live ADMIN role grant" },
        { "status": 404, "code": "MEMBER_NOT_FOUND", "when": "member does not exist" },
        { "status": 409, "code": "MEMBER_WITHDRAWN", "when": "member already withdrew" },
        { "status": 409, "code": "ALREADY_RESTRICTED", "when": "a live restriction already exists for the principal" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "adminMemberRelease",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/admin/members/:id/release",
      "authentication": "admin",
      "source": "services/backend/src/admin.ts",
      "paramsSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["id"],
        "properties": { "id": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" } }
      },
      "requestSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["reason"],
        "properties": {
          "reason": { "type": "string", "minLength": 2, "maxLength": 500 }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": ["released", "restrictionId", "revokedAt", "memberId"],
          "properties": {
            "released": { "type": "boolean", "const": true },
            "restrictionId": { "$ref": "#/definitions/Uuid" },
            "revokedAt": { "$ref": "#/definitions/Timestamp" },
            "memberId": { "$ref": "#/definitions/Uuid" }
          }
        }
      },
      "errors": [
        { "status": 400, "code": "INVALID_REQUEST", "when": "reason shorter than 2 characters or schema violation" },
        { "status": 401, "code": "AUTH_REQUIRED", "when": "missing or malformed Authorization header" },
        { "status": 403, "code": "ADMIN_REQUIRED", "when": "session is valid but has no live ADMIN role grant" },
        { "status": 404, "code": "MEMBER_NOT_FOUND", "when": "member does not exist" },
        { "status": 409, "code": "NOT_RESTRICTED", "when": "the principal has no live restriction" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "adminReviewList",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/admin/reviews",
      "authentication": "admin",
      "source": "services/backend/src/admin.ts",
      "querySchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "limit": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{1,3}$" },
          "offset": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{1,6}$" }
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": ["reviews", "total", "limit", "offset"],
          "properties": {
            "reviews": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/definitions/AdminReview" } },
            "total": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
            "limit": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
            "offset": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 }
          }
        }
      },
      "notes": "Moderation read path (WS-56). Returns hidden and visible rows alike, newest first, so the operator can find the id that hide/unhide take. The author nickname is the only identity exposed, matching the public projection.",
      "errors": [
        { "status": 401, "code": "AUTH_REQUIRED", "when": "missing or malformed Authorization header" },
        { "status": 403, "code": "ADMIN_SESSION_REQUIRED", "when": "the bearer token is a member session, not an admin session" },
        { "status": 403, "code": "ADMIN_REQUIRED", "when": "the session owner has no live ADMIN role grant" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "adminReviewHide",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/admin/reviews/:id/hide",
      "authentication": "admin",
      "source": "services/backend/src/admin.ts",
      "paramsSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["id"],
        "properties": { "id": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" } }
      },
      "requestSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["reason"],
        "properties": { "reason": { "type": "string", "minLength": 2, "maxLength": 500 } }
      },
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": ["id", "hiddenAt", "hiddenReason", "hidden"],
          "properties": {
            "id": { "$ref": "#/definitions/Uuid" },
            "hiddenAt": { "$ref": "#/definitions/Timestamp" },
